 are mean&#x000b1;SD. Comparison between control group and overt hypothyroid patients before treatment (<sup>*</sup><italic>p</italic>&#x0003c;0.01, <sup>&#x02020;</sup><italic>p</italic>&#x0003c;0.001). Comparison of overt hypothyroid patients before and after treatment (<sup>&#x02021;</sup>p&#x0003c;0.05, <sup>&#x000a7;</sup><italic>p</italic>&#x0003c;0.001). Comparison between control group and treatment group <sup>&#x02225;</sup><italic>p</italic>&#x0003c;0.05, <sup>&#x000b6;</sup><italic>p</italic>&#x0003c;0.01, <sup>**</sup><italic>p</italic>&#x0003c;0.001.</p><p>BMI, body mass index; Free T<sub>3</sub>, free triiodothyronine; Free T<sub>4</sub>, free thyroxine; TSH, thyrotropin; LDL-C, LDL-cholesterol; HDL-C, HDL-cholesterol; TC, total cholesterol; Hcys, homocysteine.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>